OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after fatal
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash on A52
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Fox, 50, of Talbot Court,
OL,7,FRadcliffe on Trent, Nottingham, has
OL,8,Fbeen charged with causing death by
OL,9,Fdangerous driving, police said. He is
OL,10,Fdue to appear at Leicester Magistrates'
OL,11,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
